        "original_id": "0f32620e-341d-53dd-adb3-dd75834d808e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cat Sandion\n- Organizations: Turner\n- Products: Hi-5, Cartoonito, CITV, Boomerang\n- Roles: television presenter\n- Places: United Kingdom, Ireland, Italy, Europe, Middle East, Africa\n\nFacts:\n- Cat Sandion is a British television presenter.\n- Since 2008, Cat Sandion has worked as a presenter and began her television career as a member of the first UK version of the Australian children's TV show Hi-5.\n- The UK version of Hi-5 featuring Cat Sandion was broadcast on Cartoonito and CITV.\n- Cartoonito is a pre-school brand owned and distributed by Turner.\n- Cartoonito is available as dedicated television channels in the United Kingdom, Ireland, and Italy.\n- Cartoonito is also available as a branded block of content on Boomerang across Europe, the Middle East, and Africa.",
